{"synopsis":"Oleh studio yang membawakan Return of the Mount Hua Sect\nLee Gilsoo berpindah sekolah untuk menghindari bullying organisasi yang seperti neraka\nDi sekolah yang baru tidak ada pembully maupun bullying tapi ada kekerasan di sekolah\nDunia yang dipenuhi kekerasan yang adil antar murid Arena Bertarung\nDi dalam Arena Bertarung para murid saling bertarung dan menikmati kekerasan\nBisakah Lee Gilsoo yang seumur hidup hanya pernah dihajar menyesuaikan diri dengan dunia yang penuh dengan kekerasan ini\nIni adalah kisah aksi mengenai perkembangan di sekolah yang berdarah dari korban bully yang menyendiri Lee Gilsoo..","alternative_title":"폭력의 왕","author":"Han Kyeong-Chan","artist":"LICO","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"af8f50c8-f26f-4c01-841a-9cf4c134216c","number":"63","chapter":"63","title":"","date":"2025-07-26","released":"2025-07-26","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_6592d419-fa6e-432a-9d5f-aab1ca71ee4a/chapter_ch_1/1.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_6592d419-fa6e-432a-9d5f-aab1ca71ee4a/chapter_ch_2/2.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_6592d419-fa6e-432a-9d5f-aab1ca71ee4a/chapter_ch_3/3.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_6592d419-fa6e-432a-9d5f-aab1ca71ee4a/chapter_ch_4/4.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_6592d419-fa6e-432a-9d5f-aab1ca71ee4a/chapter_ch_5/5.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_6592d419-fa6e-432a-9d5f-aab1ca71ee4a/chapter_ch_6/6.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_6592d419-fa6e-432a-9d5f-aab1ca71ee4a/chapter_ch_7/7.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_6592d419-fa6e-432a-9d5f-aab1ca71ee4a/chapter_ch_8/8.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_6592d419-fa6e-432a-9d5f-aab1ca71ee4a/chapter_ch_9/9.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_6592d419-fa6e-432a-9d5f-aab1ca71ee4a/chapter_ch_10/10.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_6592d419-fa6e-432a-9d5f-aab1ca71ee4a/chapter_ch_11/11.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_6592d419-fa6e-432a-9d5f-aab1